{
  "slug": "the-design-library",
  "name": "The Design Library",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A full design suite for Claude Code: 58 brand design systems (Stripe, Linear, Vercel, Google,\nAnthropic and more) + 5 curated skills for UI/UX generation, accessibility auditing, motion design,\nweb guidelines, and the full design lifecycle. Auto-activates relevant skills based on your project\ntype.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `a11y` (Run a comprehensive accessibility audit using 11 WCAG 2.2 AA specialist agents), `design` (Load and apply brand design systems from the awesome-design-md library), `design-library` (Use when working on UI, frontend, or design tasks, or when a brand design system has been loaded…), `design-process` (Access 63 specialized design skills across the full design lifecycle — research, systems, UI, interaction, strategy, and delivery), `designer-skills` (Use when guiding any phase of the design process — from research and strategy through UI design, interaction…), `guidelines` (Audit UI code against 100+ web interface guidelines from Vercel — covering accessibility, forms, dark mode, typography, animation,…), `motion` (Audit motion design and animations using perspectives from Emil Kowalski, Jakub Krehel, and Jhey Tompkins), `taste` (Give generated frontends good taste — stops generic, boring \"AI slop\" UI with tunable design variance, motion intensity,…), and 4 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `playwright`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install the-design-library@claude-community` from `zeta92/design-library-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
